This Rust port (crates/akuma-hid) follows `sys/dev/hid/hid.c` structurally —
`hid_get_item` -> `HidParser::next_item`, `hid_locate` -> `locate`,
`hid_get_data` -> `get_bits`, `hid_report_size` -> `report_size` — so the
notice above must stay attached to the port and to any derived work. The
same text is reproduced at the top of `src/lib.rs`.
